When I attacked this in a perl script some time ago, I worked by
creating regexps for the different classes of rafsi, and then
attempting to match the entire word against more and more rafsi at a
time until something fit. It has some false positives (it treats
illegal lujvo and cmavo clusters as though they were normal lujvo),
but it gets the job done.

